  title: G O O D   M O R N I N G
  button: GOOD MORNING
  riddle: A pan, an egg, strawberries, cheese, a spatula, a plate, a ladle, a fork,
    a glass and a box of sugar. Someone is up before you.
  hint: She looks to the left. The spatula and the plate stand up as her tall chef's
    hat, the cheese is her nose, the egg her bun and the sugar box her shoulders.
  complete: 'GOOD MORNING


    Breakfast is served.'
  accent: {r: 0.98, g: 0.55, b: 0.3, a: 1}
  lamps: 00000000
